<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng places US$15 mln fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng places US$15 mln fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dao Heng Bank Ltd, a unit of Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd, has privately placed a US$15 million fixed-rate certificates of deposit issue, dealer Westpac Banking Corp's Hongkong branch said.</p>
<p>The six-month certificates, which were issued under the bank's HK$18 billion CD programme, were priced at a discount.</p>
<p>The governing law is in Hong Kong law.</p>
<p>The payment date is June 25.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
